\begin{eqnarray*}
& & \mathbb{E}_{i_{k}}\left[ \left\langle\widetilde{\nabla}^{k}, x^{k+1}-x^\star\right\rangle \right]  \\
&\leq& - \mathbb{E}_{i_{k}}\left[\frac{1}{2 \eta}\left\|x^{k+1}-x^{k}\right\|^{2}\right]+\frac{1}{2 \eta}\left\|x^{k}-x^\star\right\|^{2}-\frac{1+\eta \mu}{2 \eta} \mathbb{E}_{i_{k}}\left[ \left\|x^{k+1}-x^\star\right\|^{2}\right]+h(x^\star) - \mathbb{E}_{i_{k}}\left[ h\left(x^{k+1}\right)\right] .
\end{eqnarray*}

Canceling out and rearranging the terms, we have
\begin{eqnarray*}
